    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d350">

                <pb facs="0691" n="555" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./336:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-03-19T18:00:00-05:00">March 19, 1929—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>23. Your 27, March 14, 5 p.m. What effect will rejection have upon operations in
                    Honduras? Do you consider that it would help matters to effect an exchange of
                    notes as was done recently with Colombia?<anchor n="16" xml:id="d350-f1"/> See
                    press release of February 23.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
